        </h1>

        <div className="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto md:mx-0">
          <strong className="text-gray-900 font-semibold block mb-4 text-2xl">浅墨青言，资深艺术总监。</strong>
